---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Topbar from "@/components/Topbar.astro";
import SiteFooter from "@/components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy & cookies">
  <div class="bg-cosmic min-h-screen p-4 sm:p-8">
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <Topbar />
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-6 text-white backdrop-blur-xl sm:p-8">
        <h1 class="mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-200 to-purple-200 bg-clip-text text-3xl font-bold text-transparent">
          Privacy & cookies
        </h1>

        <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-blue-100/70">
          This page explains how HardFeelings uses strictly necessary session cookies and where account data lives. It
          is not legal advice.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Who this notice is for</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
          HardFeelings is a training-plan web app. This notice applies on the hostname in your browser’s address bar,
          including the current Cloudflare Worker deployment and a later custom domain if one is attached.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Cookies — purpose</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
          After you sign in, we set strictly necessary session cookies through Supabase Auth and the server-side cookie
          adapter. Their purpose is to keep you signed in so we can show your own training plan. Cookie names follow
          Supabase’s <code class="text-purple-200">sb-…-auth-token</code> pattern (sometimes split into chunks). We do not
          set analytics, advertising, or other optional cookies, and we did not add a tracker.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Cookies — retention</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
          These cookies last until you sign out or the auth session expires. Access tokens are short-lived and refreshed
          while you remain signed in.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Legal basis</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
          We use these cookies to provide the account and training-plan service you requested (performance of a
          contract). They are strictly necessary for that login.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Other data</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
          If you create an account, your email and training data (weekly kilometres, races, plan units, workout logs,
          and chat) are stored in Supabase and isolated per member. Cloudflare hosts the app. When chat LLM is enabled,
          OpenAI may process chat content. There is no cookie consent banner because there are no optional cookies.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-blue-100/60">
          <a href="/" class="text-purple-300 hover:underline">Back to home</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      <SiteFooter />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
